hing catastrophic  should happen  so what have we got well recommendations  are being written to bigquery and google  cloud storage  as they always have been but now they're  being copied into google cloud bigtable  products are stored in datastore again  as they always were but are now being  cached in memory store  and kept up to date using invalidation  triggered through google cloud pub sub  our clients hit us using either protobuf  over http 1.1  or grpc over http 2 and the whole thing  is deployed into google kubernetes  engine  i'd like to thank you all for listening  and thank you to google for giving us  the opportunity to speak to you today  you

